{%- comment -%}
  Prints the alt text of a gallery image: its own alt, or the fallback when that alt is empty or
  only spaces. An existing alt always wins. The gallery and the zoom modal pass the product title,
  so a localized image (custom.gallery_nl / custom.gallery_fr) without alt text in Files is not
  silent. The value is not escaped here: the caller escapes it or hands it to image_tag.

  Accepts:
  - alt: {String} The image's own alt text
  - fallback: {String} What to print when there is none

  Usage:
  {%- capture media_alt -%}
    {%- render 'kc-media-alt', alt: media.alt, fallback: product.title -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if alt == blank -%}
  {{- fallback -}}
{%- else -%}
  {{- alt -}}
{%- endif -%}
